== CANON-13 Q2: TSuit(I) of an I outside 0..3 stops the program with
== "integer conversion out of range".
Type
    TSuit (Club, Diamond, Heart, Spade)

Main :
    I := 3
    PutLn(TSuit(I))
    I += 1
    PutLn(TSuit(I))
;
